# BusinessOS does not load this file automatically.
# Local secrets belong in deploy/env/.env.dev, .env.staging, and .env.prod-local.
# Create those files with:
#   powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\deploy\scripts\setup-local.ps1
#
# See deploy/README.md for the local development, staging, and production-simulation commands.
#
# Sophia chat, embeddings, and speech read Ai:OpenAiApiKey from configuration.
# Leave it empty to disable paid OpenAI calls. Do not put a real key in this file.
# Chat model: gpt-4o-mini. Embeddings: text-embedding-3-small. Speech: gpt-4o-mini-tts.
# Sophia answers in English, Urdu, Roman Urdu, and Arabic. See docs/Sophia-Language.md.
